    <briefdescription>
<para>Tracks the pointer over a plot from the plot&apos;s mouse and hover events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A touch places the pointer where the finger is and leaves it there after the release, until the next tap or mouse movement. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
